## Modular Implementation Components

### Directory: [MODEL BUILDING](file:///d:/An%20Intelligent%20Public%20Transport%20Delay%20Prediction%20and%20Route%20Optimization%20System%20Using%20Machine%20Learning/MODEL%20BUILDING)

#### [NEW] [01_data_audit_and_leakage_checks.py](file:///d:/An%20Intelligent%20Public%20Transport%20Delay%20Prediction%20and%20Route%20Optimization%20System%20Using%20Machine%20Learning/MODEL%20BUILDING/01_data_audit_and_leakage_checks.py)
- Ingests `final_integrated_dataset.csv`.
- Validates data types, missing values, and chronological timestamps.
- Runs automated assertions confirming zero correlation between inputs and post-event targets (`actual_arrival`, derived metrics).
