#### [NEW] [02_feature_engineering_pipeline.py](file:///d:/An%20Intelligent%20Public%20Transport%20Delay%20Prediction%20and%20Route%20Optimization%20System%20Using%20Machine%20Learning/MODEL%20BUILDING/02_feature_engineering_pipeline.py)
- Performs strictly ordered temporal train (2022-2024), val (2025), and test (2026) splits.
- Builds Scikit-Learn `ColumnTransformer` (RobustScaler, OneHotEncoder) fit **ONLY** on the Train split.
- Generates 3D sequential tensors for BiLSTM: `[batch_size, sequence_length=9, num_features]`.
- Saves preprocessors to `OUTPUTS/Preprocessor/`.

#### [NEW] [03_train_xgboost_regressor.py](file:///d:/An%20Intelligent%20Public%20Transport%20Delay%20Prediction%20and%20Route%20Optimization%20System%20Using%20Machine%20Learning/MODEL%20BUILDING/03_train_xgboost_regressor.py)
