- Evaluates on 2026 Out-of-Time test set: RMSE, MAE, $R^2$, MAPE, and Accuracy ($\pm 3\text{ min}$).
- Computes TreeSHAP beeswarm and waterfall explanations.
- Saves all model files, metrics, and plots to `OUTPUTS/Regressor/XGBoost Regressor/`.

#### [NEW] [04_train_bilstm_attention_regressor.py](file:///d:/An%20Intelligent%20Public%20Transport%20Delay%20Prediction%20and%20Route%20Optimization%20System%20Using%20Machine%20Learning/MODEL%20BUILDING/04_train_bilstm_attention_regressor.py)
