- Evaluates on 2026 Out-of-Time test set sequences.
- Extracts Attention Weights matrix ($\alpha_1 \dots \alpha_9$) to identify bottleneck stops.
- Saves all model weights, metrics, loss curves, and attention heatmaps to `OUTPUTS/Regressor/Bidirectional LSTM with Bahdanau Attention/`.

#### [NEW] [05_train_xgboost_classifier.py](file:///d:/An%20Intelligent%20Public%20Transport%20Delay%20Prediction%20and%20Route%20Optimization%20System%20Using%20Machine%20Learning/MODEL%20BUILDING/05_train_xgboost_classifier.py)
- Trains **XGBoost Multi-Class Classifier** (`multi:softprob` with class weighting) for Disruption Labels & Occupancy tiers.
- Evaluates Macro F1, Balanced Accuracy, Precision, Recall, and Confusion Matrices.
- Saves model, metrics, and PR curves to `OUTPUTS/Classifier/XGBoost Classifier/`.

#### [NEW] [06_train_random_forest_classifier.py](file:///d:/An%20Intelligent%20Public%20Transport%20Delay%20Prediction%20and%20Route%20Optimization%20System%20Using%20Machine%20Learning/MODEL%20BUILDING/06_train_random_forest_classifier.py)
- Trains **Random Forest Classifier** as baseline comparison with MDI Gini feature importances.
- Saves model, metrics, confusion matrix, and feature importance bar chart to `OUTPUTS/Classifier/Random Forest Classifier/`.

#### [NEW] [07_route_optimization_simulation.py](file:///d:/An%20Intelligent%20Public%20Transport%20Delay%20Prediction%20and%20Route%20Optimization%20System%20Using%20Machine%20Learning/MODEL%20BUILDING/07_route_optimization_simulation.py)
- Constructs road network graph using `dim_road_network`.
- Implements Dynamic Cost Function:
  $$W(e) = \text{FreeFlowTravelTime}(e) + \hat{\text{Delay}}_{ML}(e) + \alpha \cdot \mathbb{I}(\text{incident}_e)$$
- Benchmarks Static Dijkstra vs Dynamic ML-Augmented Dijkstra vs A* Search; computes minutes saved during traffic spikes.
- Saves benchmark metrics and detour map visualizations to `OUTPUTS/Route_Optimization/`.

#### [NEW] [08_generate_master_comparison_summary.py](file:///d:/An%20Intelligent%20Public%20Transport%20Delay%20Prediction%20and%20Route%20Optimization%20System%20Using%20Machine%20Learning/MODEL%20BUILDING/08_generate_master_comparison_summary.py)
- Ingests metrics from all 4 models and generates unified comparison tables (`master_model_comparison_table.csv` and `.json`) and summary radar comparison charts in `OUTPUTS/Model_Comparison_Summary/`.

