2. **Temporal Split Check**: Confirm strict chronological ordering ($\text{Max}(\text{Train}) < \text{Min}(\text{Val}) < \text{Min}(\text{Test})$).
3. **Regression Benchmark**:
   - XGBoost & BiLSTM-Attention benchmark ($R^2 > 0.60$, $\text{RMSE} < 3.5\text{ min}$, $\text{Accuracy}_{\pm 3\text{min}} > 80\%$).
4. **Classification Benchmark**:
   - Macro $F_1 > 0.85$ on Disruption State classification.
5. **Folder Verification**:
